-["quest","179","details","What do we have here? You look as though you might need something to keep your hands warm, hm?\n\nI'll tell you what would help: a pair of nice, warm gloves. And, being the kind soul that I am, I'd be more than happy to provide you with a suitable pair. I've one condition, however.\n\nI need you to go get me some wolf meat. Nice arrangement, hm? You bring me some wolf meat, and I'll make sure you don't lose any digits to frostbite. Well, what do you say?","70450",["eadd9cf3"]],
-["quest","179","ender","npc:658","70450",["9de05506"]],
-["quest","179","giver","npc:658","70450",["ecca565c"]],
-["quest","179","objectives","Sten Stoutarm would like 8 pieces of Tough Wolf Meat.","70450",["11d1ec8c"]],
-["quest","179","request","Wolves giving you a bit of trouble? You'd do well to avoid the fangs and claws and other sharp bits, yes?","70450",["9314933a"]],
-["quest","179","reward","Ah! Wonderful. The wolf meat should do nicely. Oh, don't worry, $N, I wouldn't forget my part of the bargain. Here, one of these should fit you.","70450",["b485dd88"]],
-["quest","179","title","Dwarven Outfitters","70450",["96a72d68"]],
