+["quest","179","request","Wolves giving you a bit of trouble? You'd do well to avoid the fangs and claws and other sharp bits, yes?","70790",["9314933a"]],
+["quest","179","reward","Ah! Wonderful. The wolf meat should do nicely. Oh, don't worry, $N, I wouldn't forget my part of the bargain. Here, one of these should fit you.","70790",["b485dd88"]],
