+["quest","182","details","My brother Senir and I were sent to different parts of Dun Morogh to investigate the threat posed by the trolls. The Senate has its hands full with the troggs, so they've no need for further annoyances.\n\nFrom what I've seen, the trolls aren't well situated here in Coldridge Valley--mostly the southern cave. I'd say that the army will not be necessary. A few strong arms should be more than enough.\n\nPerhaps you'd like to assist in this endeavor? I have the authority to offer compensation for your help.","70790",["c35b71d3"]],
+["quest","182","giver","npc:786","70790",["51bd4d1d"]],
+["quest","182","objectives","Grelin Whitebeard would like you to kill 14 Frostmane Troll Whelps.","70790",["fc5afd1b"]],
+["quest","182","title","The Troll Cave","70790",["ca62571d"]],
+["quest","182","where","[1426,25,75.7]","70790",["3dcbd6e7"]],
+["quest","183","details","Nothing like a day of boar hunting, eh?\n\nThough, here in Coldridge Valley, there are so many boars it almost takes the fun out of it. No need to get them charging. They're all angry and ready without any help. In fact, recently, there've been so many boars in the area, it's become dangerous for me to do my daily hunting.\n\nLong story short, if you could help me kill some of the boars, I would appreciate it.","70790",["24ae1aa7"]],
+["quest","183","ender","npc:714","70790",["3fbe790f"]],
+["quest","183","giver","npc:714","70790",["dd9a488d"]],
+["quest","183","objectives","Talin Keeneye would like you to kill 12 Small Crag Boars.","70790",["6d2dca4d"]],
+["quest","183","reward","Excellent! I can go back to my... leisurely... hunting now. Thank you, $N.","70790",["2fe698ad"]],
+["quest","183","title","The Boar Hunter","70790",["4801ae90"]],
+["quest","183","where","[1426,22.7,71.5]","70790",["2c83321c"]],
+["quest","233","details","Hm, I don't suppose you'd be willing to do a favor for me, lass? A stack of letters came through the pass today, but I don't have the time to send them along.\n\nThey're all addressed to Talin Keeneye. You can find him to the west down the road. He's set up camp next to the frozen lake.\n\nWhat do you say?","70790",["8a88e997"]],
+["quest","233","ender","npc:714","70790",["4f03f2ae"]],
+["quest","233","giver","npc:658","70790",["db038b39"]],
+["quest","233","objectives","Deliver the stack of letters to Talin Keeneye.","70790",["aa4816d9"]],
+["quest","233","request","Yes? Do you have something for me?","70790",["d1d8bfbe"]],
+["quest","233","reward","Thank you, I've been waiting for these letters for quite some time...\n\nUnfortunately, these letters aren't all for me. This one is addressed to Grelin Whitebeard. He's not too far away if you'd like to deliver it to him.","70790",["dde3170c"]],
+["quest","233","title","Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery","70790",["88dc907e"]],
+["quest","233","where","[1426,29.9,71.3]","70790",["b1fbb0db"]],
+["quest","234","details","If I remember correctly, Grelin's camp is down the road to the southeast. No doubt he'll be eager to get his mail.","70790",["835f054c"]],
+["quest","234","ender","npc:786","70790",["9915770c"]],
+["quest","234","giver","npc:714","70790",["775ba919"]],
+["quest","234","objectives","Deliver the letter to Grelin Whitebeard.","70790",["ca3b6a2d"]],
+["quest","234","request","Is there something I can help you with?","70790",["e3aa1fe3"]],
+["quest","234","reward","Ahh, excellent. It's been a while since I received word from Ironforge. Ach, these letters from me mum warm my heart. Here, not fair you don't get some readin', too. Take one of these manuals we have lyin' around.","70790",["099ae79e"]],
+["quest","234","title","Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery","70790",["ab6f4ad2"]],
+["quest","234","where","[1426,22.7,71.5]","70790",["9aa46a6e"]],
@@ -422,0 +739,18 @@
+["quest","3361","details","We drove the troggs out of Gnomeregan, but then it all went so horribly wrong!  Now our home is completely irradiated, and we gnomes have been scattered all over Dun Morogh.\n\nIn my haste to get away from the radiation, I lost all my personal belongings and tools.  It was the trolls that got them.  They stole my chest, my box, and my bucket of bolts!  They took them back to their camps southwest of Anvilmar.\n\nI'm no adventurer - could you find my things and bring them here to me, please?","70790",["d7f9419d"]],
+["quest","3361","giver","npc:8416","70790",["3e7b99ff"]],
+["quest","3361","objectives","Bring Felix's Box, Felix's Chest and Felix's Bucket of Bolts to Felix Whindlebolt in Anvilmar.","70790",["fe0801af"]],
+["quest","3361","title","A Refugee's Quandary","70790",["3e162cd6"]],
+["quest","3361","where","[1426,28.6,67.6]","70790",["5e182745"]],
+["quest","3364","details","Gah!  I was supposed to get this delicious scalding mornbrew to Durnan Furcutter inside Anvilmar a while ago now, but I had to deliver one to Grelin here first.  I'll never make it to Anvilmar before the brew runs cold!\n\nYou look fast.  Maybe you can make it.  This cup will only stay hot for five more minutes, and Durnan didn't order \"chilly\" mornbrew, so get going.  Anvilmar is to the northeast, a settlement dug into the mountain.\n\nThanks, $N, and don't forget to bring me back my mug!","70790",["cb20dc03"]],
+["quest","3364","ender","npc:836","70790",["1a12dab0"]],
+["quest","3364","giver","npc:12738","70790",["cd49b9e8"]],
+["quest","3364","objectives","Take a Scalding Mornbrew to Durnan Furcutter inside Anvilmar before it gets cold in five minutes!","70790",["12c5ec28"]],
+["quest","3364","request","Aye, I'm Durnan Furcutter.  You have something for me?","70790",["abb9daf3"]],
+["quest","3364","reward","Ah good, now this will hit the spot.  Allow me to take a small break while I enjoy this scalding mornbrew!","70790",["6c089f60"]],
+["quest","3364","title","Scalding Mornbrew Delivery","70790",["b2442e09"]],
+["quest","3364","where","[1426,24.9,76]","70790",["08ae728d"]],
+["quest","3365","details","Now that hit the spot!  Nothing like a piping hot - nay, SCALDING mornbrew on a cold winter's day to warm your cackles of yer soul.\n\nHere ya go $N - be a pal and take this empty mug back to Nori for me, would ya now.","70790",["ec5a7ea9"]],
+["quest","3365","giver","npc:836","70790",["6a45fca4"]],
+["quest","3365","objectives","Return Nori's Mug to Nori Pridedrift.","70790",["fffc3533"]],
+["quest","3365","title","Bring Back the Mug","70790",["1a962d9f"]],
+["quest","3365","where","[1426,28.8,66.5]","70790",["2395e632"]],
@@ -425,0 +760,68 @@
+["quest","92460","details","Look at you, bright eyed and ready for adventure! We need all the help we can get here in Thendal Village and your arrival is most welcome. I imagine you are brimming with nerves for what is to come. After all, you only get to come of age once in a lifetime.\r\n\r\nGo, seek out our village leader Rorian the Dayseeker at the entrance to the greatfather tree just west of here. He will get you started on your journey.","70790",["510a2613"]],
+["quest","92460","ender","npc:251361","70790",["a71790ec"]],
+["quest","92460","giver","npc:251362","70790",["285888c9"]],
+["quest","92460","objectives","Speak with Rorian the Dayseeker in Thendal Grove.","70790",["aa07d4b6"]],
+["quest","92460","reward","Gale's greetings, $N. I am honored to bestow your coming of age relic today as you are recognized for the potential you bring to the shen'dorei. Our people have faced great hardship and persecution in our complex history.\r\n\r\nToday you are given this relic which is one of many held by those before you. Someday when your ashes are scattered to the winds it will pass to another to continue our tradition.\r\n\r\nAs you take this relic with you know that the winds of home will be with you wherever you travel.","70790",["1fb0a0e0"]],
+["quest","92460","title","Coming of Age","70790",["78d10589"]],
+["quest","92460","where","[2521,42.8,23.4]","70790",["5a7c1f40"]],
+["quest","92461","details","We live in times of great uncertainty for our people. We face unprecedented challenges that may require bold solutions, but we also must contend with the ordinary and mundane here in Thendal Grove. Take, for example, the recent unsustainable rise in the vuldren population.\r\n\r\nThe vuldren are a vital part of our ecosystem. However, imbalances must be corrected to maintain the delicate harmony that all creatures in Thendal Grove share.\r\n\r\nHead east and cull some of the vuldren there.","70790",["9f3892ae"]],
+["quest","92461","ender","npc:251361","70790",["731b1fe1"]],
+["quest","92461","giver","npc:251361","70790",["8a2b5498"]],
+["quest","92461","objectives","Slay 8 Vuldren Juveniles in Thendal Grove.","70790",["20e9c6f9"]],
+["quest","92461","reward","Thank you for your service to Zephras, young $c{mage}.\r\n\r\nThe vuldren are typically quite docile, but the animals that call Zephras home can sense when the magic on the winds is out of balance, which can lead to dangerous and unpredictable behavior if left unchecked.","70790",["307fe415"]],
+["quest","92461","title","Harmony in Balance","70790",["654e9c5c"]],
+["quest","92461","where","[2521,42.1,23.5]","70790",["8f4ffaf1"]],
+["quest","92462","details","One of our rangers recently reported an infestation of cirrusflies here in Thendal Grove. \r\n\r\nCirrusflies can be dangerous if the swarm is allowed to grow too large, so please head to the eastern end of the Grove and exterminate as many as you can.","70790",["5d514a29"]],
+["quest","92462","ender","npc:251368","70790",["84d35097"]],
+["quest","92462","giver","npc:251368","70790",["860054c6"]],
+["quest","92462","objectives","Slay 8 Pesky Cirrusflies in Thendal Grove.","70790",["39711892"]],
+["quest","92462","reward","Judging by the amount of bug entrails covering you, this must be quite the infestation.","70790",["7c855d25"]],
+["quest","92462","title","Infestation Investigation","70790",["c2cd8559"]],
+["quest","92462","where","[2521,43.4,24.8]","70790",["c0c098f5"]],
+["quest","92463","details","If the forest is as thick with these insects as it sounds, simply killing the workers won't be enough.\r\n\r\nGo deeper into the forest and find the queen. She'll be close to the hive and surrounded by bigger and more aggressive soldiers, so be careful.\r\n\r\nPut her down and return here when it's done. That'll be one less problem to think about around here.","70790",["25a9d8eb"]],
+["quest","92463","giver","npc:251368","70790",["50a6e2d0"]],
+["quest","92463","objectives","Destroy the Cirrusfly Queen in Thendal Grove.","70790",["58730bf7"]],
+["quest","92463","title","The Cirrusfly Queen","70790",["faf739eb"]],
+["quest","92463","where","[2521,43.4,24.8]","70790",["01916e2a"]],
+["quest","92464","details","Ever since our elemental benefactors left us, it seems that we are simply moving from one unrest to another. The problem we face now is that the manifestations of the winds near the standing stones to the northeast are agitated.\r\n\r\nNot truly self-aware like the sentient wind spirits that once lived here, these simple sprites respond in kind to forces, emotions, and intentions of the creatures around them. \r\n\r\nMy apprentice Yala Windwatcher went to observe them. Seek her out and discover what she's learned.","70790",["0b65fa1b"]],
+["quest","92464","giver","npc:251361","70790",["1d3dad23"]],
+["quest","92464","objectives","Speak to Yala Windwatcher in Thendal Grove.","70790",["10fd85b6"]],
+["quest","92464","title","Elemental Unrest","70790",["2d6a0a5e"]],
+["quest","92464","where","[2521,42.1,23.5]","70790",["90e91c12"]],
+["quest","92474","details","Well hello there, $N! Want to play a game?\r\n\r\nAll you've got to do is step up on that ledge... then jump! Use your innate ability to walk on the air to slow your fall and see how far forward you can float.\r\n\r\nThe rules are made up and the points don't matter, but you get bonus points if you can land right in front of Rorian the Dayseeker and startle him! He won't like it but I'll certainly get a good laugh if you can get him all worked up! Hah!","70790",["8eb3478d"]],
+["quest","92474","ender","npc:251361","70790",["54ff76bd"]],
+["quest","92474","giver","npc:263113","70790",["d39f653d"]],
+["quest","92474","objectives","Jump from the top of the watchtower in Thendal Grove and use your Walk on Air ability to slow your fall.","70790",["05f41a23"]],
+["quest","92474","reward","How many times do I need to tell Myriaal not to encourage others to make reckless usage of our skyborne gifts!\r\n\r\nThat being said, I suppose that a little bit of practice in the relative safety of the village is... acceptable.\r\n\r\nIn the future I'd simply suggest you to use your ability judiciously. You do not want to exhaust your magic thoughtlessly and then not be able to use it when you truly need it.","70790",["29b586a3"]],
+["quest","92474","title","Falling With Style","70790",["73c3cb98"]],
+["quest","92474","where","[2521,43.7,24.1]","70790",["9f482b3e"]],
+["quest","92481","details","While you were away dealing with our vuldren problem, our resident $c{mage} trainer--Dorii Brightwhisper--left this recall crystal for you. It contains some sort of message for you, so give it a look. Afterwards, you can find Dorii in the structure just behind me.","70790",["afbfdc4e"]],
+["quest","92481","ender","npc:251379","70790",["9be0b5d7"]],
+["quest","92481","giver","npc:251361","70790",["0678c8b6"]],
+["quest","92481","objectives","Examine the Glowing Recall Crystal, then speak with Dorii Brightwhisper in Thendal Grove.","70790",["240a6035"]],
+["quest","92481","request","Greetings, $N. I'm pleased to have the privilege of furthering your magical studies.","70790",["6fa072b4"]],
+["quest","92481","reward","Let me have a look at you. Yes, I believe you will make a fine young $c{mage}. The power of the arcane has waned amongst our people, but there are those who would seek to rediscover much of what we've lost in the millennia we've spent here amongst the clouds. I am sure that you will lead the charge in this never ending search for arcane knowledge, and ultimately make us proud.\r\n\r\nSpeak with me again if you wish to take your next steps.","70790",["81da019e"]],
+["quest","92481","title","A Student of the Arcane","70790",["b7ef6f8e"]],
+["quest","92481","where","[2521,42.1,23.5]","70790",["6bf78327"]],
+["quest","92597","details","Here in the elemental plane, we derive much of our arcane strength from leylines that still run through the ground under our feet. Of late, these leylines have begun to pierce the surface, giving us more direct and powerful access to these latent arcane energies.\r\n\r\nGo to the standing stones to the northeast. There is a leyline there. Tap into your birthright and draw in its energy.","70790",["e65094fe"]],
+["quest","92597","giver","npc:251371","70790",["d1444e94"]],
+["quest","92597","objectives","Use your Read Leyline racial ability at the leyline in Thendal Grove.","70790",["fe70ab1c"]],
+["quest","92597","title","Reading the Leylines","70790",["37695121"]],
+["quest","92597","where","[2521,43.3,24.8]","70790",["aab804db"]],
+["quest","93552","details","Windstones are a critical resource on Zephras Isle as they contain the raw, concentrated energy of the winds themselves. The wind elementals who used to live here on Zephras with us vanished a number of years ago, and since then, the magic that sustains this island is slowly fading. Not without limitations, the windstones are still a reliable energy source, and are incredibly valuable to us.\r\n\r\nYou'll find raw windstones scattered around the grove. Think you can help me harvest them?","70790",["62e0a91f"]],
+["quest","93552","giver","npc:251363","70790",["85e797c4"]],
+["quest","93552","objectives","Collect 15 Windstone Clusters from Raw Windstones in Thendal Grove.","70790",["51462732"]],
+["quest","93552","title","Harvesting Windstones","70790",["275c773e"]],
+["quest","93552","where","[2521,43.3,23.9]","70790",["4ab54e67"]],
+["quest","94373","details","Aye, the time's come, young $c{shaman}. Ye've grown stout and sturdy, like the stone beneath our boots. Takin' up the $c{shaman}'s path shows ye've got the wisdom o' the mountain, even before ye've proven yerself. Ye've the grit of stone to walk the earth's path.\r\n\r\nBut to earn its favor, ye must face it proper. South o' here, the Frostmane trolls live in a cave.\r\n\r\nBring me two of the necklaces they wear, crafted from the Iceclaw bears. Then we'll speak more of yer future.","70790",["87d355b5"]],
+["quest","94373","giver","npc:257446","70790",["16153a59"]],
+["quest","94373","objectives","Bring 2 Frostmane Bear Pendants to Teo Hammerstorm in Anvilmar.","70790",["fdfaa3b9"]],
+["quest","94373","title","Call of Earth","70790",["41b308a0"]],
+["quest","94373","where","[1426,28.9,66.2]","70790",["f04bc63c"]],
+["quest","94414","details","Greetings, young $N. I oftentimes come here to look upon the ancient anchor pylon. Gifts from the spirits of the winds, they bind and sustain our island. Of late however, their magic has grown unstable and inconsistent.\r\n\r\nThey suffer no distress I can see. Their splendor has not changed.\r\n\r\nIf you'd like, I can lend you my gift to look upon them yourself.","70790",["c1cd2c10"]],
+["quest","94414","ender","npc:257554","70790",["f38fdfdb"]],
+["quest","94414","giver","npc:257554","70790",["3e91d55c"]],
+["quest","94414","objectives","Speak with Halaan Hawk-Eye and borrow his gift to view the anchor pylon in the distance.","70790",["95348054"]],
+["quest","94414","reward","Thank you for taking a moment to share this with me. I will continue to watch over the grove, and ponder on the state of our homeland.","70790",["32b72e80"]],
+["quest","94414","title","The Anchors of Zephras","70790",["a8f6aff9"]],
