+["quest","98581","details","While you were helping me out, this rune was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. Based on the Wildhammer style to these inscriptions, I'm guessin' this came from the $c{shaman} trainer Teo Hammerstorm. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.","70790",["18b7cf53"]],
